      },
      {
        "heading": "Which agencies, vendors, and industries account for most Texas spending?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs leads buying in Texas with $885M in FY2027 to date, followed by the Department of Homeland Security with $347M and the Department of Energy with $285M. PANTEXAS DETERRENCE, LLC is the top vendor with $281M, followed by CSI AVIATION, INC with $278M and QTC MEDICAL SERVICES INC with $246M. Offices of Physicians (except Mental Health Specialists) is the top industry with $348M, followed by Wired Telecommunications Carriers with $306M and Facilities Support Services with $284M."
      }
